OL,3,GNEWSAHow is the weather in the East of 
OL,4,AEngland changing?                      
OL,6,FFans, freezers and air conditioning    
OL,7,Funits were pushed to their limits this 
OL,8,Fsummer as we endured the hottest one on
OL,9,Frecord. Across the East of England, we 
OL,10,Fsaw weeks of temperatures close to or  
OL,11,Fabove 30C, leading to wildfires and    
OL,12,Fsome roads even melting. It feels like 
OL,13,Four seasons are changing, and the      
OL,14,Flatest research from the Met Office has
OL,15,Fbacked that up, with our winters also  
OL,16,Flooking different. But how exactly is  
OL,17,Fit changing here in our region?        
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
