OL,3,GNEWSAHow is the weather in the East of 
OL,4,AEngland changing?                      
OL,6,FRecent climate conditions from between 
OL,7,F2016 and 2025 have been compared with  
OL,8,Fthe standard climatological baseline   
OL,9,Fperiod of 1961 to 1990 by the Met      
OL,10,FOffice.                                
OL,12,FResearchers have examined changes in   
OL,13,Fthe "air frost" days from autumn to    
OL,14,Fspring, and also looked at the summer  
OL,15,Fdays reaching 25C and above.           
OL,17,FNorfolk, Suffolk and Cambridgeshire    
OL,18,Fhave witnessed particularly big        
OL,19,Fincreases in the number of summer days 
OL,20,Freaching 25C or higher.                
